Package: rubyc
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gcc, binutils
Description: Ahead-Of-Time Ruby to x86-64 native compiler
 rubyc is an Ahead-Of-Time Ruby compiler written in Rust that compiles Ruby
 source code directly into x86-64 System V ABI assembly and links it with an
 embedded C runtime to produce standalone native ELF64 executables.
